---
title: Staff - Register Staff Flow (POST /staff/register)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Manager Client
    participant Ctrl as StaffController
    participant Guard as AuthGuard
    participant RGuard as RolesGuard
    participant Service as StaffService
    participant AccountModel as AccountModel (TypeORM Repository)
    participant StaffModel as StaffInfoModel (TypeORM Repository)
    participant Util as Security Utils (bcrypt)
    participant DB as Database (SQL Server)

    note right of Client: POST /staff/register (with Bearer Token)
    Client->>Ctrl: RegisterStaffDto (username, password, fullName, cccd, phone, address, birthDate, role)
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl->>Guard: canActivate(context)
    Guard->>Guard: Verify JWT
    Guard-->>Ctrl: Attach user to request & return true
    Ctrl->>RGuard: canActivate(context)
    RGuard->>RGuard: Resolve metadata @Roles('Manager')
    RGuard-->>Ctrl: return true

    Ctrl->>Service: createStaff(dto)
    activate Service

    Service->>Service: isValidRole(dto.role)
    opt Invalid Role
        Service-->>Client: Throw ConflictException (Role not allowed)
    end

    Service->>AccountModel: findOne({ username })
    AccountModel->>DB: SELECT * FROM Accounts WHERE Username = ?
    DB-->>AccountModel: row / null
    AccountModel-->>Service: Account Entity / null
    opt Username exists
        Service-->>Client: Throw ConflictException (Username already taken)
    end

    Note over Service, DB: Run inside Transaction (dataSource.transaction)

    Service->>Util: bcrypt.hash(dto.password, 10)
    Util-->>Service: passwordHash

    Service->>AccountModel: save(AccountEntity)
    AccountModel->>DB: INSERT INTO Accounts (Username, Password, IsActive, Role) ...
    DB-->>AccountModel: persisted Account
    AccountModel-->>Service: Account Entity

    Service->>StaffModel: save(StaffInfoEntity)
    StaffModel->>DB: INSERT INTO StaffInfo (AccountId, CCCD, FullName, Phone, Address, BirthDate) ...
    DB-->>StaffModel: persisted StaffInfo
    StaffModel-->>Service: StaffInfo Entity

    Service-->>Ctrl: StaffInfo Entity
    deactivate Service
    Ctrl-->>Client: HTTP 201 - StaffInfo Entity
    deactivate Ctrl
